---
synopsis: Rename lookup*Program* functions
packages: [Cabal, cabal-install]
prs: 12021
---
Introduce `lookupAndConfigureProgramVersion` and
`lookupConfiguredProgramVersion`, deprecating the (functionally
identical) `lookupProgramVersion`. The new functions are explicit about whether
the program should be configured on the fly, or expected to be already
configured.
